Subject: [PATCH] [rust jpeg] Progressive raw replay (PR487)

Backport of https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/487
Published head: b75b845ba71c5302428e191f62261b7d31fe2c51

Effective cumulative source stage: b75b845ba71c5302428e191f62261b7d31fe2c51
Only this stage's new Rust-source delta is carried. Prerequisite changes are not duplicated in later PR patches.

